text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Breeding Pit unless you pay {B}{B}.\nAt the beginning of your end step, create a 0/1 black Thrull creature token.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Kuro, Pitlord unless you pay {B}{B}{B}{B}.\nPay 1 life: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Barren Moor enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {B}.\nCycling {B} ({B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Choose one —\n• Target player gains 3 life.\n• Prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', 'Choose one —\n• You draw five cards and you lose 5 life.\n• Create an X/X black Demon creature token with flying, where X is the number of cards in your hand.\nEntwine {4} (Choose both if you pay the entwine cost.)', 'Corrupt deals damage to any target equal to the number of Swamps you control. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Discard a card, Sacrifice Overeager Apprentice: Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'Each player sacrifices two creatures.', 'Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice a creature.\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 and has trample.\nEnchanted creature is a Demon Spirit.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2 as long as it's white. Otherwise, it gets -2/-1.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+1.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying and vigilance.', "Enchant permanent\nWhen Faith's Fetters enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.\nEnchanted permanent can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated unless they're mana abilities.", 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\nWhenever a creature you control attacks alone, you may tap target creature.', "Exile target creature. At the beginning of the next end step, return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.", 'Flying', 'Flying\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'Flying\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Flying\nDaggerclaw Imp can't block.", "Flying\nHellbent — Demon's Jester gets +2/+1 as long as you have no cards in hand.", 'Flying\nSacrifice a creature: Fallen Angel gets +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\nWhen Angel of Mercy enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\nWhen Foul Imp enters the battlefield, you lose 2 life.', "Flying\nWhen Reiver Demon enters the battlefield, if you cast it from your hand, destroy all nonartifact, nonblack creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Flying\nWhenever Abyssal Specter deals damage to a player, that player discards a card.', 'Flying\nWhenever Angelic Protector becomes the target of a spell or ability, Angelic Protector gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Flying\nWhenever Stinkweed Imp deals combat damage to a creature, destroy that creature.\nDredge 5 (If you would draw a card, you may mill five cards instead. If you do, return this card from your graveyard to your hand.)', 'Flying\nWhenever Sustainer of the Realm blocks, it gets +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\nWhenever a player casts a nonblack spell, that player loses 1 life.', 'Flying\n{T}: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{T}: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{T}: Target player loses 1 life.', 'Flying, first strike, vigilance, trample, haste, protection from black and from red', "Flying, trample\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice a creature other than Lord of the Pit. If you can't, Lord of the Pit deals 7 damage to you.", 'Flying, vigilance', "Flying, vigilance\nWhen Twilight Shepherd enters the battlefield, return to your hand all cards in your graveyard that were put there from the battlefield this turn.\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'Marble Diamond enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W}.', 'Pay 3 life: Put a +1/+1 counter on Souldrinker.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Secluded Steppe enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W}.\nCycling {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Spend only black mana on X.\nConsume Spirit deals X damage to any target and you gain X life.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target opponent sacrifices a creature.', 'When Abyssal Gatekeeper dies, each player sacrifices a creature.', 'When Venerable Monk enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.', 'Whenever Charging Paladin attacks, it gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature attacks, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a black spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a white spell, you may gain 1 life.', '{1}{W}{W}: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.']
